=2 Walkthrough
* Defeat 11 {m:Obstreperous Panopts|Obstreperous Panopt}.
** Many spawn around (F-11) -- just north of **Ethereal Ingress** #1.
** They are not difficult to defeat, but the area is full of other aggressive mobs.
** Players should purchase a {@k} {k:Mollifier} KI from {n:Shiftrix} prior to completing this Mission otherwise the NM {m:Ascended Panopt} can spawn.
** Zoning will reset your progress. You will receive a message informing you how many remain upon each kill.
** Thanks to the June 2016 version update, the {@k} {k:"Rhapsody in Fuschia"} will reduce the level of any {m:Obstreperous Panopts|Obstreperous Panopt} claimed by the player while on this mission.
*** Appears to decrease the Panopts to level 112, regardless of their initial starting level (122~124).
** {p:Record of Eminence, Combat (Region), Combat (Escha 2), Conflict: Reisenjima I|Category:Records of Eminence} is killing ten of these.

